/정보/class통합미완료","periodic_ring/gap/foundation_kinetics":"국소분석oracle와closure검증","legacyflow/NumPy/Rust":"main호환성보존;V1core에자동편입금지"}},"contracts":{"C_MAP":"SI m,방향/층/구조물ID명시. Polygonmask단일권위. 동일XY는접속증거아님. input IDs는관측식별용이며물리priority아님.","C_ACCESS":"ActivityMeasure→gate/time분포. 사람·차량수와확률분리. physicalaccess와generalizedcost분리. private connector와분포항중복금지. 지원외기하/예산은명시오류.","C_DEMAND":"persons,vehicles,cargo,opportunities,filledjobs별도장부. declaredtimeprofile적분을실제방출량과대조. intrazonal/noncar/unreachable를0초완료로세지않음.","C_FLOW":"stock veh또는class별길이로환산; rate veh/s; increment rate*dt. released=completed+allpending+allactive. nonnegative와공동supply/storage조건. 보존만으로안전/FIFO/shock를주장하지않음.","C_PHYSICS":"실제기초는연속(x,v)와차종/목적/정보. 계산모멘트의closure·유효범위·안정성·안전성별도. densitysquare/p두상태는일반firstprinciple이아닌조건부축약.","C_INFORMATION":"관측정보가같으면현재행동같음. direct/server/history채널의coverage/timestamp/latency명시. report범위밖은명시prior,truthfallback금지.","C_RUNTIME":"immutable transaction,명시적인fast/medium/slow단위와phase,laggedlanduse,실제checkpoint복원. partialprogress와정상완료구분.","C_IDENTITY":"graph/geometry/turn/landuse/demand/class/info/cost/version을cachekey에반영. Byte identity와physicalequivalence구별. topology변경시점유statehot-swap금지.","C_EQUIVALENCE":"물리대칭(고정환경),passive공변,표현quotient를분리. QF=FbarQ와O=ObarQ의범위명시. class/history/time를잃는병합은근사. tri/dt변화는오차로비교.","C_OBSERVATION":"출생·유출1차모멘트와source/road/interface/access/egress체류를분리. 전체평균은전체집단완료시에만;부분조건부평균은모집단명시. p95는원자료/추가moment가있을때만.","C_FAILURE":"MODEL_ERROR / NUMERICAL_ERROR / IMPLEMENTATION_ERROR / ENVIRONMENT_BLOCKER / BLOCKED_RESOURCE / PHYSICAL_INFEASIBLE / HORIZON_REACHED 구별. 예산실패에마지막validcheckpoint,질량삭제없음.","C_PLAN":"PLAN.json이 유일한 규범 원본이며 MASTER_PLAN_KO.md/DAG/PR_CATALOG는 생성 뷰다. 노드별 실행은 정의·유도·코드·검증·관측을 연결한다. 생성 뷰 불일치는 계획 오류로 거절한다. validate는 구조/추적성을 검사할 뿐 과학적 참이나 실행 이력의 진실을 대신하지 않는다. release 검사에는 모든 노드의 수용상태와 실제 영수증 경로·SHA256을 요구한다."},"numerical_policy":{"mass_relative_tolerance":1e-09,"residence_relative_tolerance":1e-08,"report_absolute_floor":1.0,"interpretation":"tol=relative*max(1,해당누적량).